/// its colour baked onto a shared atlas page. They live in `IdolProps.reality`, one model each,
/// named `Idol_<raw value>`, in metres at their real size, the flat bottom (or, hung on a wall,
/// the flat back) at y = 0 under the pivot, the front facing +z.
enum IdolProp: String, CaseIterable, Sendable {
